# Changelog

All notable changes to the EMA Landing Page project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased] - 2025-01-17

### Added

- **Enhanced Integration Section Design & Performance**: Comprehensive improvements to visual appeal and performance
    - **Fancy Title Styling**: Enhanced title presentation with modern visual effects
        - Gradient Animation: Added animated gradient text effect with blue color transitions for the highlighted title part
        - Typography Consistency: Updated to match HeroSection and ComparisonSection styling patterns using `font-playfair` class
        - Responsive Design: Implemented consistent text sizing (`text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl`) across all sections
        - Text Effects: Added `tracking-tighter` and `animate-gradient-shift` for professional appearance
        - Clean Typography: Removed text shadows for cleaner, more modern appearance
        - Floating Decorative Icons: Added subtle animated geometric shapes (star, circle, polygon) around the title
        - Design System Integration: Unified styling approach across all major landing page sections
        - Custom CSS Animations: Added `animate-gradient-x`, `animate-float`, `animate-float-delayed`, and `animate-float-slow` animations
    - **Enhanced Logo Visibility**: Significantly improved integration card logos and icons
        - Advanced Card Styling: Added gradient backgrounds, hover effects, and scale animations
        - Logo Container Enhancement: Larger (16x16) icon containers with gradient backgrounds and shadow effects
        - Interactive Effects: Shimmer overlays, glow effects, and smooth hover transitions
        - Color Coordination: Enhanced text colors that change on hover for better visual hierarchy
        - Professional Depth: Multi-layered effects with blur, shadow, and gradient combinations
    - **Performance Optimization**: Implemented lazy loading for EmaFullScreenSection
        - Intersection Observer API: Only loads iframe when section is 50% visible
        - Smart Pre-loading: Starts loading 100px before coming into view
        - Memory Efficiency: Prevents unnecessary iframe rendering until needed
        - Smooth Loading: Maintains loading states while optimizing resource usage
    - **Color System Consistency**: Updated all CTA buttons to match ContactModal design
        - Primary Buttons: All now use `bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600` for consistency
        - Secondary Buttons: Outline buttons use `border-blue-500 text-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-500`
        - Enhanced Shadows: Added `hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-500/30` for depth
        - Unified Brand Experience: All interactive elements now follow the same color scheme
- **Smart Button Positioning System**: Intelligent conflict detection and positioning for EMA modal button
    - Auto-Detection: Automatically detects existing floating buttons (WhatsApp, chat widgets, etc.)
    - Smart Positioning: Dynamically adjusts EMA button position to avoid overlap conflicts
    - Admin Control: WordPress admin panel options for manual button positioning
    - Position Options: Multiple positioning choices (auto, bottom-right, bottom-right-high, bottom-left, top-right)
    - Conflict Resolution: When conflicts detected, automatically positions EMA button 80px above existing buttons
- **Localization System**: Complete internationalization support with Turkish (tr), English (en), and French (fr) languages
    - Language Selector: Interactive language selector in navbar with flag icons and dialog interface
    - Dynamic Language Routing: Middleware-based routing with `/[language]` path structure
    - Language Context: React context for managing language state and translations
    - Translation Files: Comprehensive JSON translation files for all three supported languages
    - Metadata Localization: Language-specific meta tags and SEO optimization
    - Language Detection: Automatic language detection from URL, localStorage, and Accept-Language header
    - Route Management: Dynamic routes for language-specific pages with proper redirects
- **EmaModal Component**: Implemented persistent floating chat modal component
    - Floating action button positioned in bottom-right corner
    - Auto-open functionality based on scroll position (75%) and exit intent
    - Multi-stage modal with hero screen and embedded chat iframe
    - Tooltip appears after 8 seconds of inactivity
    - Notification badge with pulsing animation
    - Keyboard navigation support (ESC to close)
    - Customizable branding, colors, and messaging
    - Support for product thumbnails and social proof display
    - Integrated into main layout for global availability
- Added comprehensive French localization for new landing page sections
- Added `features` section with detailed key functionalities of EMA including:
    - Natural language processing with advantages
    - Multilingual support benefits
    - Contextual understanding capabilities
    - Customer analytics features
- Added `comparison` section with feature comparison table between EMA, touchscreen, and human staff
- Added `faq` section with categorized frequently asked questions covering:
    - Technical specifications
    - Installation process
    - Usage instructions
    - Privacy policies
    - Pricing information

